###GET the count of employess - $count
http://localhost:4004/odata/v4/CatalogService/EmployeeSet/$count


###GET call with pagination - $top, $skip
http://localhost:4004/odata/v4/CatalogService/EmployeeSet?$top=2&$skip=2

###Select few fields - $select
http://localhost:4004/odata/v4/CatalogService/EmployeeSet?$select=nameFirst,nameLast,email

###GET call with filtering - $filter
http://localhost:4004/odata/v4/CatalogService/EmployeeSet?$filter=sex eq 'M'

###GET call with pattern match -
http://localhost:4004/odata/v4/CatalogService/EmployeeSet?$filter=Contains(nameFirst,'ch')

###GET call to load Single Employee data
#http://localhost:4004/odata/v4/CatalogService/EmployeeSet/d34bef56-c0d5-4086-957c-526e09ae59e1
http://localhost:4004/odata/v4/CatalogService/EmployeeSet('d34bef56-c0d5-4086-957c-526e09ae59e1')

###POST - to create new employee
POST http://localhost:4004/odata/v4/CatalogService/EmployeeSet
Authorization: Basic anubhav:
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "nameFirst": "Christiano",
  "nameMiddle": null,
  "nameLast": "Ronaldo",
  "nameInitials": "Mr",
  "sex": "M",
  "language": "E",
  "phoneNumber": null,
  "email": "christ@anubhavtrainings.com",
  "loginName": "RONALDOCH",
  "currency_code": "EUR",
  "salaryAmount": 86574,
  "accountNumber": "76543210",
  "bankId": "66665555",
  "bankName": "Indusind Bank"
}

###PATCH - to update data
PATCH http://localhost:4004/odata/v4/CatalogService/EmployeeSet/efa32671-33b0-4e3c-8903-4f6af75e7217
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "salaryAmount":10000000,
    "currency_code": "USD"
}

